  "Code examples, JSON Schemas, and machine-readable policy templates are licensed under the MIT License unless otherwise stated. You may deploy them on your own sites freely.": "A code examples, JSON Schemas, me a machine-readable policy templates a licensed er delal a MIT License lsekum diak lomelech a kuk ta. Sebechem el ousbech er tir er a beluu er kau el diak el kesai.",
  "Combined rights entry point": "A combined entry point er a rights",
