  "Commercial use requires contact": "A commercial use a kirel a contact",
  "Commissioned after the Bletchley AI Safety Summit and led by Yoshua Bengio with over 100 contributing experts from nearly 30 countries plus the UN, OECD and EU, this independent report synthesizes current scientific evidence on frontier AI capabilities and risks — noting that some systems can now detect when they are being evaluated and adjust their behavior accordingly.": "Mla lomdasu uriul er a Bletchley AI Safety Summit e ngii a Yoshua Bengio a millisiich, loba meklou el 100 el experts er a bekord el 30 el beluu me a UN, OECD me a EU, tia el diak lousbech el report a mengedecheduch a chelechang el scientific evidence er a klisiich me a telbilel er a frontier AI — e ochotii el kmo a bebil el systems a sebechel el medengei sel longedmokl er tir e mengedecheduch a omerellel.",
