  "Correct positioning: independent research drafts, protocol proposals, and an open specification experiment.": "A meral el llechelel: diak lousbech el research drafts, protocol proposals, me a klekedall er a open specification.",
  "Corrected an earlier default: Belgium (BE) now maps to Dutch instead of French — Flemish speakers are the country’s majority (~60%) over Walloon French speakers (~40%).": "Ulderchii a kot el default: Belgium (BE) chelechang a mo er a Dutch diak el French — a Flemish speakers a klou er a beluu (~60%) er a Walloon French speakers (~40%).",
  "Corrected an earlier default: Kazakhstan (KZ) now maps to Kazakh instead of Russian, now that a Kazakh translation exists — the same kind of fix as the earlier Belgium correction.": "Ulderchii a kot el default: Kazakhstan (KZ) chelechang a mo er a Kazakh diak el Russian, leng ngar er ngii a Kazakh translation — el ua di ta el ulderchelel a Belgium.",
